  "memories": [
    {
      "id": "m-20250608-0",
      "key": "mem_20250608_0",
      "day": "20250608",
      "text": "Master Thwaite set the glass down after one turning, and then read a portion of the Homily against Disobedience and Wilful Rebellion.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250608/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250608",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250608#meeting_080500_480",
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250608#meeting_092000_720",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250608#meeting_123000_720"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250609-1",
      "key": "mem_20250609_1",
      "day": "20250609",
      "text": "Garnish stopped at fifteen. Margery said they laughed like men who mean to laugh at something else after. Richard shrugged. You kept her sentence.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250609/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250609",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250609#meeting_081500_360",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250609#frame_111000_240",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250609#meeting_160500_720"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250610-2",
      "key": "mem_20250610_2",
      "day": "20250610",
      "text": "The deposition is three sheets on the board.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250610/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250610",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250610#frame_035000_240",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250610#frame_051500_240",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250610#note_074000_240"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250611-3",
      "key": "mem_20250611_3",
      "day": "20250611",
      "text": "Two Gentlemen was an ordinary house. You marked the full moon.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250611/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250611",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250611#meeting_082000_300",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250611#frame_110000_180",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250611#meeting_161000_300"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250612-4",
      "key": "mem_20250612_4",
      "day": "20250612",
      "text": "The order is two sleeves, six shillings, payment on delivery. The sentence, if anyone asks, is Norwich. Nobody came.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250612/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250612",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250612#meeting_090500_720",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250612#frame_104000_180",
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250612#meeting_123000_360"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250613-5",
      "key": "mem_20250613_5",
      "day": "20250613",
      "text": "By the telling that reached the window, about three hundred apprentices sold the sellers' butter at threepence and paid the money over.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250613/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250613",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250613#meeting_082000_300",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250613#frame_111500_240",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250613#frame_141000_180"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250614-6",
      "key": "mem_20250614_6",
      "day": "20250614",
      "text": "Leadenhall cried butter at fourpence. The loaf is a thumb short of the notch. The flag was up for the Shrew, and the yard was thin.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250614/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250614",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250614#call_073000_240",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250614#frame_073000_120",
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250614#photo_084000_0"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "said": [
    {
      "id": "s-20250608-0",
      "key": "said_20250608_0",
      "day": "20250608",
      "quote": "Forty pence is a hired man's supper and a week's regret.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250608#meeting_123000_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250608-1",
      "key": "said_20250608_1",
      "day": "20250608",
      "quote": "Whitsun. She looked, or she looked at the window. Leave it.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/household/activities/20250608#memo_214000_60"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250609-2",
      "key": "said_20250609_2",
      "day": "20250609",
      "quote": "The hush came late and broke early.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250609#memo_212000_120"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250610-3",
      "key": "said_20250610_3",
      "day": "20250610",
      "quote": "The cat has chosen the deposition. A critic.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250610#memo_211000_60"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250612-4",
      "key": "said_20250612_4",
      "day": "20250612",
      "quote": "That is fair. I am sorry I made a speech of it.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250612#meeting_090500_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250613-5",
      "key": "said_20250613_5",
      "day": "20250613",
      "quote": "They paid. That's the thing. They didn't steal it.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250613#memo_170000_120"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250613-6",
      "key": "said_20250613_6",
      "day": "20250613",
      "quote": "A just price sounds different depending on whether you buy or sell.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250613#memo_170000_120"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250614-7",
      "key": "said_20250614_7",
      "day": "20250614",
      "quote": "We play. An old comedy. Nothing with a crowd in it, and nothing with a crown.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250614#call_073000_240"
      }
    }
  ]
}
